FONT 8,"MS Shell Dlg",0,0,0
STYLE WS_POPUP|WS_VISIBLE|WS_CLIPSIBLINGS|WS_CAPTION|WS_SYSMENU|DS_MODALFRAME|DS_SETFONT|DS_3DLOOK
